{"asset_key":"timeline/quest_story_13209120","episode":"timeline","category":"quest_story","story_id":"13209120","schema_version":1,"lang":"cn","texts":{"cinematic_dialogue:2:1320911001:":{"text":"你是魔法师吧？好帅啊！","source_cn":"你是魔法师吧？好帅啊！","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0xA7273713069BFC24","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"你是魔法师吧？好帅啊！","female":"你是魔法师吧？好帅啊！","variant_male_record_index":"148082","variant_female_record_index":"148083","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"cinematic_dialogue:2:1320911002:":{"text":"哎？！那个幽灵跑了！","source_cn":"哎？！那个幽灵跑了！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xE85366A09D4E51D4","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1320912001:0":{"text":"主人，那个幽灵好像逃往墓园的方向了！我们得赶快追上去，不然她就要消失了！","source_cn":"主人，那个幽灵好像逃往墓园的方向了！我们得赶快追上去，...","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x311FD020A456A5B0","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"主人，那个幽灵好像逃往墓园的方向了！我们得赶快追上去，不然她就要消失了！","female":"主人，那个幽灵好像逃往墓园的方向了！我们得赶快追上去，不然她就要消失了！","variant_male_record_index":"148084","variant_female_record_index":"148085","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1320912002:0":{"text":"等一下！满满，我们不能把瑙姆一个人留在这里。","source_cn":"等一下！满满，我们不能把瑙姆一个人留在这里。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x63AE321F948631E8","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:9:1320912003:0":{"text":"……你们怎么知道我叫瑙姆的？！","source_cn":"……你们怎么知道我叫瑙姆的？！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xFCFD5FE6C79243AA","variant_st